window.products.push({"id":719037,"name":"Whatever Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SCD3buIfL._AC_.gif","description":"Brand New Funny 'Whatever' wall clock-Novelty numbers [1039] Funny clock features black rim with \"What Ever!\" dial face and novelty Arabic numbers. This unique clock can spice up your modern room. Dimensions: 10.5\" Dia x 1.5\" Deep High quality quartz movement powered by one \"AA\" battery (not included), keeps accurate time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SCD3buIfL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laurel","source_asin":"B001G6MK64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001G6MK64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001G6MK64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719038,"name":"Whiskey Decanter Gift Set ?Long Island? 5-Piece (1 Carafe + 4 Glasses) incl. Lucky Coin in Box. Premium 100% lead-free Crystal Glass for Liquor, Bourb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TkQZClJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The art of drinking whiskey Drinking whiskey, Scotch, bourbon or other high quality liquor must be a ceremony of pleasure. All of the details count and make a difference between “just drinking alcohol” and enjoying the moment. Whiskey is a beverage normally aged at least a couple of years in wooden barrels. Sipping and savoring the spirit is an element of sensualizing the history of the beverage and feeling the flavors which is a combination of smell and taste. The element of smell is the reason why whiskey glasses should be broad in shape. After a small sip and “rolling” the liquid around in your mouth, instead of just swallowing right away, try to pick out different flavors. Since whiskey is always aged in wooden barrels, you’ll almost always get the classic flavors of vanilla, toffee or caramel. Enjoy your drink over the course of 30-60 minutes, with good company of course! The legend of Adam Franklin \"Having read many books and lots of materials about the exciting time of the Glided Age (time between the Civil War and the 1900), I could recognize the strong advancement of the U.S. cultural growth during this era. In my mind I have developed a character of that time: Mr. Adam Franklin, who was the man of this period. He valued the great things around him and respected the history. It is our mission to transfer these values through our products and the materials around them. Join us on the journey of passionate love for the joy of life and the appreciation for beautiful details!\" Creator of Adam Franklin Michael Mariakhin The ideology of Adam Franklin 1881: enjoy the beautiful things We tend to keep the most valuable and beautiful things for a special occasion. However, that special occasion may never occur. We should live in the present and enjoy the magnificent things that surround us. Create your atmosphere. Now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TkQZClJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adam Franklin","source_asin":"B07L1XKY5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L1XKY5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L1XKY5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
