window.products.push({"id":719108,"name":"Potato Ricer and Masher, Makes Light and Fluffy Mashed Potato Perfection, Potato Masher with 3 Interchangeable Discs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhnFN9SBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mashed potatoes are an essential and delicious dish for us. When you come home from tiring work, there’s nothing more comforting than having a bowl of mashed potatoes. Fluffy and smooth Mashed Potato with milk and butter, isn't it all you want?  But before you meet our products, you need to spend a lot of time and energy to make mashed potatoes, and the end result may not be fluffy mashed potatoes. Let’s face it, it will only make you feel worse.  You need an efficient product to make a quick work of an otherwise tedious process, that is our potato ricer.   Potato Ricer is an easy-to-use tool for making mashed potatoes. You can easily make smooth, fluffy mashed potatoes with Potato Ricer. 3 interchangeable discs for a variety of mashed potato meals. You can also take any root vegetable and turn them into the perfect grained meal just the way you want!  This wonderful kitchen tool is Made of 100% stainless steel. It is stain-resistant and rust-proof. It’s safe, easy to use, and clean-up is also a breeze. Most importantly it is dishwasher safe.  What are you waiting for? Add to cart, you deserve it.   Instructions   First, choose the size of your “rice” and get the corresponding disc.   Then, get your potato or any vegetable you want to mash up. Before that, you need to cook these foods thoroughly.   Finally press the handle and you will get the grain you want.   Product advantages  High-quality and heavy duty material  Comes with 3 changeable discs - fine, medium, coarse  Comfortable ergonomic design  Easy to clean and dishwasher safety  Dimensions   Overall length : 11.42 inches   Overall Width : 3.54 inches   Overall Depth : 5.51 inches   Package Includes    Potato ricer   3 X changeable discs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhnFN9SBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asng","source_asin":"B08FY6VD4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FY6VD4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FY6VD4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
