window.products.push({"id":719116,"name":"WEDDINGSTAR Custom Embroidered Plush Christmas Stockings - Falling Snowflakes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C3wEI+iXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cost of embroidery included! Enter your custom name, date, or text to be embroidered onto the Christmas Stocking to make this a truly unique & personalized gift at no additional cost! DIMENSIONS: 7.7\" (L) x 18.5\" (H). Loop attached for easy hanging. This Christmas, make the fireplace mantle the focal point of your holiday décor with a personalized Christmas stocking that includes this beautiful white and gold snowflake patterned stocking. If there’s no mantle in your home, no problem, the traditional design of the large Christmas stocking includes a loop attached to the white, gold-trimmed cuff for easy hanging so it can be part of any unique display. Hang your stocking from staircases, bookshelves, or any number of special spots. The Christmas stocking is personalized with a name or monogram embroidered across the cuff to ensure Santa will know which family member each stocking belongs to. The plush decoration is ideal if you’re looking for a special stocking for a new family member, like a husband, wife, baby, or pet, but for a cheap price, you can also get a matching set if you’re looking to update your Christmas decorations. Get a stocking set that’s entirely matched with only the embroidered name or initials on them to set them apart or mix and match with one of our other luxury stockings to create a specialty set that’s perfect for your latest holiday aesthetic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C3wEI+iXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WeddingStar","source_asin":"B09JYBZKJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYBZKJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYBZKJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
