window.products.push({"id":719227,"name":"Home-Man Waterproof Sherpa Fleece Pet Blanket, Soft Plush Throw Protects Couch, Chairs, Car, or Bed from Spills, Stains, or Pet Fur, Machine Washable,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u+hN2h0dL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"WATERPROOF - This blanket can protect your furniture and make your pet feel comfortable while spending time with the family. The internal LINING provides extra defense against damage and stains, effectively stopping liquids from seeping through. VERSATILE - The Blanket provides protection from stains, spills, and pet fur, while also being an attractive throw on your sofa, chairs, or bed. The fabulous color enhances this blanket with an elegant and superior appearance to complement your room a chic feeling. It’s ideal for protecting carriers, kennels, or the seats in your car while you travel with your furry friend. It also can even be used as a moving blanket. REVERSIBLE and MACHINE WASHABLE - This supper soft blanket with Fuzzy Fleece Face on one side and Plush Sherpa on the other, your dog, cat, or other pets will love to snuggle up on this warm and cozy blanket. This blanket is easy to clean and care for. Simply machine wash cold and tumble dry low. FABULOUS BLANKET BENEFITS - This blanket is perfect for homeowners with sophisticated tastes in decoration home - The fabulous color enhances this blanket with an elegant and superior appearance to complement your room a chic feeling - Shield a layer to protect your luxury bed and couch from dirt and stain to keep them fresh and clean. PRODUCT DETAILS - 220GSM Flannel+ 220 GSM Sherpa. Dimensions: 60” x 50”. Color: Gray. This comfy, cozy and ultra-plush warm Sherpa blanket provides better fade & stain resistant than cotton blankets - Unlike cotton has little elasticity to retain shape, microfiber blanket will NOT bunch with time. Gifts for Men and Women; Moms and Dads, Valentine's, Mother's and Father's Day; Christmas and New Year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u+hN2h0dL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-Man","source_asin":"B082T2D8MM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082T2D8MM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082T2D8MM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
