window.products.push({"id":719229,"name":"Microwave Filter Replacement For Frigidaire 5304464105 GE WB06X10608 Microwave Grease Filter 5.12\" x 7.64\" (2-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EcAsZVdBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Microwaved foods often generate grease within the appliance. That said, range hoods and over-the-range microwaves are commonly equipped with grease filters that trap grease, smoke and other pollutants and circulate out clean air. This microwave filter has a metal pull D-ring tab attached that makes replacing the filter simple. Please ensure the above dimensions match your existing filter before purchasing this oven filter. Also make sure your microwave does not require two filters, as some do.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EcAsZVdBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bagean","source_asin":"B01EB2MLCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EB2MLCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EB2MLCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719230,"name":"University of Kentucky Chrome Double Rung Neon Clock - Reflection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UP-St5nsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This officially licensed Neon Wall Clock is the perfect addition to any game room, garage or man cave. This impressive clock has two neon rings; one is an accent colored neon ring on the exterior and the other is a brilliant white neon ring on the interior of the clock to light up your favorite logo. Other highlights include chrome finished resin housing and a high-grade glass clock face cover. The battery-operated quartz clock mechanism will keep it ticking for a long time, while the neon runs off the included AC adapter. The neon is controlled by the pull chain and the back of the clock includes a wall hanging mount and has two modes - solid state and blinking. The 3\" depth of this clock combined with the radiant shimmer of the neon reflecting off the chrome housing is sure to make this clock pop on any wall! IMPORTANT: Avoid buying counterfeit products and transacting with unauthorized sellers. Look for the officially licensed decal on every one of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UP-St5nsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Gameroom","source_asin":"B00UOYDDHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UOYDDHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UOYDDHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719231,"name":"Now Designs Stoneware Pitcher, Canyon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Oh+OaEmCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a dose of embossed elegance to your table with glazed stoneware pitchers by Now Designs. With a classic shape and deep, smooth pouring spout, these pitchers are as functional as they are beautiful. Each pitcher is made from sturdy stoneware with a shiny, glazed finish. Use these pitchers for water, juice, milk and more. Or, fill with flowers for a decorative touch. Care is simple, dishwasher safe. Designed and made by Now Designs: creators of exclusive home and kitchen products with style and the finest quality in mind for 50 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Oh+OaEmCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B078J56V88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078J56V88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078J56V88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719232,"name":"SUPER DEAL End Table Narrow Nightstand Modern Accent Sofa Side Table with Drawer and 2 Open Storage Shelf for Living Room, Bedroom, Office, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hp9FiYLUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Space Saving Design】Overall Dimensions: 11.8”L x 23.8”W x 24”H; Weight Capacity: Up to 55 pounds for tabletop, up to 20 pounds for the bottom 2 shelves. This narrow end table has a good amount of space for storage, you can also add a basket to the bottom shelf to hold some smaller items as well. Perfect for end tables next to couch, tv stand or coffee tables, fits easily in narrow nooks and cramped corners 【Reliable Material & Durable】This mini end table is made of high quality medium density fiberboard(MDF) and Pine. With 2-tier and rectangular design, it offers a durable and stable daily use to last years. come. Bathed in a dark wood hue and punctuated with fluted details and an oil rubbed effect, this end table has timeless appeal. The pine legs comes with foot pad, this give the entire unit much more stability and rigidity than it would have with an all particle board assembly 【Wide Application yet Classy Looking】1 Drawer and 2 Open Storage Shelf - The mini sofa side table featured a sliding drawer and 2 open shelves provide extra storage and display space. Top surface is perfect for putting your lamp, phone, photo, decors while the lower shelf is ideal to store your books, sundries box or other daily necessities to save space. The handy drawer is quite deep, great for hiding remotes and stuff etc 【Compact Size Modern Furniture】1 Drawer and 2 Open Storage Shelf Purpose-made for Cutting Clutter - Narrow, but deep, the table offers some flat surface anyway, and 2 closed cabinet provide a place for magazines, spare batteries, and more. 2 open shelf offers a place to store and showcase favorite photographs, it offers space aplenty for anything you want to keep close at hand. An essential in any living room or bedroom arrangement, end tables act as a perch for lamps, books, and other decorative accents 【Easy to Assembe】- Overall size:23.8 in x11.8 in x 24 in(L x W x H), Net weight: 17.6lb. Hardware and instructions are all included. Simply follow the instruction to complete the assembly step by step. What’s more, we have professional customer service, feel free to contact us if there is any product issue, any email will be replied within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hp9FiYLUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPER DEAL","source_asin":"B0BN1N1HTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN1N1HTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN1N1HTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719233,"name":"Butane Torch with Fuel Gauge,Homitt Refillable Cooking Torches with One-handed Operation &Safety Lock,Adjustable Flame,Fit All Butane Tanks Kitchen Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yE9D7269L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to wow your friends with mouth-watering and delicious food on party? Now you’re a step closer to make you cook like a pro: Armed with Homitt kitchen blow torch, let your culinary cred go through the roof! Cool features that make Homitt butane torch stand out: Fuel gauge windowSafety stopperFit all butane canistersTrue one-handed operationContinuous Flow1300℃/2500℉ high temperature20-50 minutes using time Aluminum alloy & fire-resistant ABS materialComfortable handle Compact & sleek design Sweet Tips: 1. Do not exceed the MAX line when filling gas, otherwise a long flame will rush out from the tube after ignition. If needed, let out some butane by depressurize the valve with the tool included 2. Use the outer part of flame to heat, for it’s the hottest part and using outer part means keeping proper distance between food and tube, which prevents the flame from back burning3. Do not continuously use the torch more than 5 minutes, take a break to let it cool down before another use, which will greatly expand the lifespan of the culinary torch4. Do not touch the fire or the flame guard tube when using; children are not allowed to use the Creme Brulee torch without supervision5. In order to assure safety transportation, this cooking blow torch comes with no gas. Way to refill the torch 1. Depressurize the torch: press the filling valve of the torch with the tool for about 10s2. Refill gas: turn the torch upside down, for long nozzle butane tank: just insert the nozzle pipe into the filling valve of the torch; for short nozzle butane tank: connect the adapter to the butane nozzle and insert the adapter end into the filling valve of the torch3. 5 minutes of standing: turn the torch over and check .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yE9D7269L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PanaceLife","source_asin":"B08GS21X8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GS21X8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GS21X8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
