window.products.push({"id":719236,"name":"First Christmas in a New Home 2022 for A Couple Personalized Ornament by Calliope Designs - Handcrafted - 4.5\" Tall - Customization of Names, Year, Ph","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d1ZR5HiRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Give a really special gift! When your ornament is customized we add the names and the year that you give us when you “Customize Now”. Imagine how pleased the recipient will be when they see their names on their gift and know you took the time to order something unique, something made just for them. Be creative if you like! Some products have room to add a holiday greeting or a phrase that relates to the design of the ornament. This ornament is “First Christmas in Our New Home” as pictured on the ornament. You can choose the same phrase or you may create your own wording in that spot. Such as the Family Name and the address. It’s your chance to be creative and find just the perfect sentiment for your family or friends. Free personalization by hand: When you customize now you can be sure your request will be carefully entered on to the ornament by a trained employee. Style will vary from artist to artist but you can be sure all lettering will be done to our high standards of attractiveness and legibility. Permanent black ink will be used to avoid fading and smudging Fast turnaround with very careful packaging: Even during the very busy months of November and December our handling time is 1 to 2 days. We don’t ship in paper envelopes! Ornaments are packed in a sturdy new tuck top mailer box protected by extra bubble wrap to insure it arrives safely. We use USPS to mail and always provide tracking info with each shipment. Our sturdy box can be used for storage after Christmas. Add to their collection! A personalized ornament gift with the year on it has become an annual tradition for many families. From Engagement, Marriage, Home, and Pregnancy an ornament celebrating those times are a basis for the couple’s future life together followed by vacation souvenir ornaments, hobby ornaments, new job ornaments. A lifetime of fun memories rekindled each time the tree is decorated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d1ZR5HiRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calliope Designs","source_asin":"B001KUTNSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001KUTNSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001KUTNSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
