window.products.push({"id":719296,"name":"ECO bedding Body Pillow Cover, 300 Thread Count 100% Long Staple Cotton Sateen 20 x 54 Inches Body Pillow Case, Pillowcase with Envelope Closure, Silv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I076kMq4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Do you ever have enough body pillowcases? Not only do they update the look of your bedspread, but also help keeping your skin blemish free and most importantly, provide a place to rest your head! Outfit your body pillow in understated style with ECObedding clean-lined pillow cover. 100% Cotton Unlike polyester bedding, cotton fibers wick away moisture, making bedding extremely breathable.Eco bedding's sateen pillow cases are made of 100% long-staple cotton. 300 Thread Count Thread count refers to the number of threads that make up one square inch of fabric. Typically, the finer the threads that can be woven together, the softer the fabric. Thread counts can range from 150 to 1,000. The higher the thread count, the more expensive the fabric.300 thread count percale weave offers breathability and stays cool to the touch, making it ideal for warm climates or summer months. Unique Design Envelope Cover fully covers and protects your body pillow and keeps it clean. It also prevents the body pillow cover or zipper from scratching you, and looks much better than an open ended pillow case.Sateen Finish for a smooth surface and luminous sheen.Double Stitched Seams for quality and durability. Care Instructions Wash before first use. Machine wash warm or cold. Wash dark colors separately. Do not bleach. Dry on medium heat. Warranty If you are at all unsatisfied, simply let us know and you will receive a full refund or a new product Note There may be 1-3cm(1\") deviation exist. Every package includes only one cover, NO PILLOW.Although we try our best to reflect true shade on every photo, different mobile phones or computers show them differently. So actual color/shade may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I076kMq4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECO bedding","source_asin":"B07DHNQCJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DHNQCJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DHNQCJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719297,"name":"National Tree Company First Traditions Duxbury Christmas Tree with Hinged Branches, 6 ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":144.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NYOEIYn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Effortlessy set up this remarkably realistic Christmas tree that is constructed with hinged branches for easy set up. Suitable as indoor holiday décor, display this artificial Christmas tree in a front hall, living room, at the bottom of a staircase, or any place with high foot traffic for all to see and enjoy. Constructed with sturdy, high quality materials, this artificial Christmas tree is built to bring holiday cheer to your home for years to come. Invite the spirit of the holiday season into your home with the First Traditions Collection by National Tree. Whether you’re starting new traditions or honoring classics with your family, our decorations seamlessly transform any space while you focus more on creating new magical moments.Includes one artificial Christmas tree with 800 that measures 6 ft. tall and 40\" in diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NYOEIYn-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Tree Company","source_asin":"B0BKC21L84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKC21L84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKC21L84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
