window.products.push({"id":719306,"name":"12 Packs Sequin Table Runner Baby Blue 12 X 108 Inch Glitter Dining Table Runner for Birthday Wedding Engagement Bridal Baby Shower Bachelorette Holid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81puar3KneS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sparkly Sequin Table Runner Features: 1.This sequin fabric has a metallic feel that can wear out over time, fit for on a 6ft/8ft table but can also be styled to fit either a longer or shorter table. 2.Make your wedding day or party magical by dressing tables: simply lay this unique table runner along your tables to make the party set-up. 3.This gorgeous sequin table runner is suitable for weddings, birthday parties, baby shower, anniversaries, classic candy buffets, dessert tables and other special events.  4.Our shinny table runner offers a sparkle effect that is going to make your special moments even more memorable. Amazing sequin runners decorate Christmas and Thanksgiving dinners and other formal or informal gatherings. 5.Our glitter table runners are designed for a variety of happy occasions: suitable for your dining-room table, kitchen table, Cafes, restaurants, diners, catering, weddings, brunches, buffets, parties, picnics, outdoor patio table and more.  Specification: Quantity: 12 Pieces Material: High Quality Polyester, Sequin, Mesh Cloth Size: 12\" W x 108\"L Pattern: Romantic & Vintage  Color: Baby Blue Wash Tips:  Special materials, it is recommended to gently clean and air dry. Do not machine wash and iron. If it is dirty after use, you can hand wash it with a mild detergent in cold water.  Do not soak for too long or use hot water, no bleach, hanging dry, do not twist.  Package Includes: 12 x Baby Blue Sequin Table Runner Warm Notice:  Please allow a slight size error due to manual measurement. Please allow a slight color error due to different displays. Due to the characteristics of sequin fabrics, a small amount of sequins will fall off when the sequin tablecloth is taken out of the package, and it only needs to be shaken slightly, which is normal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81puar3KneS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fivenl","source_asin":"B097P4G95H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097P4G95H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097P4G95H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719307,"name":"Hopeseily Stronger Magnetic Curtain Tiebacks, Convenient Curtain Holdbacks, Round Rope European Simple Style Drape Tie Backs for Window Décor(2 Pack, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OzBhHr1oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chic Design: This exquisite curtain tieback is hand-made with high-quality polyester material. The tight cotton rope rotates in an orderly arrangement into a circle, simple yet delicate and beautiful. The designer meticulously designed a new round European-style strong magnetic curtain holdback, which is very suitable for European-style retro country-style curtains and home decoration. Upgraded Strong Magnetic: We adopt the design of the upgraded version of the strong magnetic buckle with the screw center of gravity so that the curtain tiebacks can maintain strong suction for a long time, durable, and easy to fix. The magnetic buckle adopts a nickel-plated process, which has the effect of anti-corrosion, which is beautiful and can maintain the Curtain holdbacks of the band for a long time. Easy to Use: Just wrap the curtain in the Curtain holdbacks, and then suck both ends of the magnetic buckle, the curtain can be easily fixed in a few seconds. No need to drill holes to damage the wall, no tools. The operation is simple and convenient, even children can use it easily. It is the ideal thing for your home accessories. Wide Applications: Exquisite Curtain holdbacks are suitable for any venue with window curtain and sheer curtains, perfect for home, office, coffee shop, bedroom, living room, dining room, balcony, and make your life more delicate and beautiful. It is also a good idea to give it to a friend as a small gift. Package Included: The package contains 2 pack round rope European simple style magnetic curtain tiebacks, with a total length of 19.3 inches. You can adjust the length and tie off the curtain straps according to the thickness of the Curtain holdbacks to achieve the best decoration and fixation effects. The designer has selected five versatile and classic colors beige, blue, gold, black, grey to meet your needs for matching any curtain color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OzBhHr1oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hopeseily","source_asin":"B093L2C474","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093L2C474","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093L2C474","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
