window.products.push({"id":719312,"name":"Chantal Pure Make and Take 1-3/4-Quart Round Casserole","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516YkXmhMwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Calm, practical, and progressive, Chantal's Pure ceramic line offers an appealing way to align dishware with environmental prudence. Typical ceramic manufacturing processes rely on heavy metals, polluting dyes, and special protective equipment. The result is air pollution, groundwater runoff, and extensive use of resources. In contrast, Pure's use of clear glaze minimizes pollutants, while conserving fuel by firing quickly at lower temperatures. Chantal estimates that the overall conservation is as high as 50 percent. Plus, thanks to warm and welcoming aesthetics, Pure requires no sacrifice of design. Crafted with accommodating side handles and smooth rims, the pieces have a soothing, natural vanilla color with a slight gloss. Subtle imperfections add to the dishes' natural feel. A useful piece amongst the Pure collection, this 1-3/4-quart covered round casserole offers make-and-take convenience--use it for transporting vegetables, side dishes, fruit salads, small casseroles, and more to potlucks, picnics, the neighborhood block party, and other fun gatherings. Microwave-safe and oven-safe up to 425 degrees F, the unit's stay-put lid features a removable BPA-free silicone gasket that creates an air-tight seal, which allows for marinating, baking, or storing left-overs in the refrigerator for later. Best of all, the unit's glazed surfaces can be written on with a permanent marker. Drop it off at the neighbor's house with \"Get well soon!\" or store it in the refrigerator with instructions for the babysitter: \"Heat at 350 degrees F for 30 minutes\". The ink won't come off on hands, but it will effortlessly wash off with warm, soapy water. Measuring approximately 10 by 7 by 5-4/5 inches, the container cleans up quickly by hand or in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516YkXmhMwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chantal","source_asin":"B001PKU2W0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001PKU2W0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001PKU2W0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
