window.products.push({"id":719341,"name":"Buckwheat Hulls Side Sleeper Pillow - Edomi Cube Neck Pillow for Sleeping Back Support Relieve Shoulder Pain Rectangle Cervical Pillows with Pillow Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k4f7DfZ0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable: Buckwheat hull pillows are designed with a zipper, our pillow cover has outer cover zipper and inner case zipper. allowing you to add or remove filling to adjust the loft and firmness to your personal preference. Cooling technology: The buckwheat cooling pillow helps to regulate your body temperature throughout the night, ensuring that you sleep comfortably and wake up feeling refreshed. The buckwheat hulls used in the pillow are breathable and allow for air circulation, which helps to keep you cool all night. Excellent Support: The cube shape design of the buckwheat pillow ensures that it provides optimal support for your neck and head. Helps to align your spine, reduce pressure points, and alleviate pain, making it ideal for people who suffer from neck or back pain. Durable: Buckwheat hulls are very durable and can last for several years without losing their shape or support. They also do not compress like other pillow materials, ensuring consistent support throughout the life of the pillow. Size: The size of the neck pillow is 17x10 inches, making them a popular choice for people looking for a comfortable and supportive pillow. The size is perfect for people who want a comfortable and supportive pillow without it being too large or bulky.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k4f7DfZ0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Edomi","source_asin":"B09CQ5BQZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CQ5BQZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CQ5BQZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
