window.products.push({"id":719389,"name":"5 Black Thin Quad Overlap DVD Empty Replacement Boxes with Wrap Around Sleeve #DV4R14BK (14mm) (4DVD)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EErrzKY5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These are Quad DVD boxes with a hinged tray. These boxes hold 4 DVD's in the space of one standard (14mm) DVD case! These cases have a full clear wrap-around sleeve (this is where you slide the front paper / artwork into so it shows). From the outside, they look like a standard black single DVD box, but inside the overlapped trays allow for holding 4 discs in a minimum amount of space! This is the perfect space saving design!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EErrzKY5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Square Deal Recordings & Supplies","source_asin":"B0026C5T0G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0026C5T0G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0026C5T0G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719390,"name":"Moon Phase Wall Hanging Handmade Hammered Gold Metal 13 Moons Garland, Boho Decor Modern Celestial Phases Decoration Bohemian Lunar Aesthetic Art, Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A+JAwmtzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙 BEAUTIFUL & STYLISH HOME DECOR: Add a touch of lunar-inspired magic to your home with this moon phases garland from Smairs. Our moon wall decor will sparkle, shine and may even chime in the wind. This moon wall art will create peace and comfort in any room. Inspired by the phases of the moon for earth star gazers and boho décor lovers, it creates an eclectic, boho aesthetic that you will adore. 🌙 HANDCRAFTED AND LONG-LASTING - The moon garland contains 13 pieces representing the phases of the moon. and carefully designed with high-quality, durable metal to ensure that it lasts for years. Each one-of-a-kind moon ornament is individually hammered with the khasar hammer to mimic the appearance of real craters on the moon’s surface. Each piece is unique and original as you are too. 🌙 AMAZING IN EVERY SPACE: Our bohemian style moon decor wall decoration measures 59 inches long, making it the perfect length to hang over a double or queen-sized bed. It is designed to be lightweight and easy to install and hang onto any wall. Whether you’re looking to decorate a home office, apartment, student dorm or nursery, you will be able to create charming room decor for women and girls with this moon phase banner. Use it as metal wall art to truly make your room stand out. 🌙 AN ACCENT FOR EVERY OCCASION: These handmade metal moon cycle banners have been designed to be original and perfect for vsco room decor or boho bedroom decor - which makes them ideal astrology gifts for women and teens. Our gold moon phase wall art will delight your wife, girlfriend, sister or daughter for Birthdays, Anniversaries, Christmas, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, graduations or any special occasion. Find the perfect gift for Mom/her. 🌙100% SATISFACTION MONEY BACK GUARANTEE - This decorative wall art creates comfort and natural life for any space, as it glistens. It will bring a mystical and eclectic touch to any room or add it to your existing decor! If you are not 100% happy with the product, we will issue a refund. Please feel free to ask any questions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A+JAwmtzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sumairs","source_asin":"B092JDKNB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092JDKNB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092JDKNB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
