window.products.push({"id":719585,"name":"DUEBEL Food Heating Bag with Planel Setting Temperature, Car Food Warmer Portable 12V Personal Oven for Car Heat Lunch Box with Adjustable/Detachable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-H8GJFZNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The panel displays the current temperature- Temperature Setting ①The factor setting default heating temperature is 45℃ ②You can also set your own temperature, setting method as follows:  ⑴Lightly press the set(left) key, and then press “+” or “-” on the right to adjust the desired temperature (up to 60℃, minmim 30℃) when the number flashes.  ⑵You can press the left button again to complete the temperature setting, or you can stop operating any key, the screen will return to the temperature display screen a few seconds later. - Other notes:  (1) The heating bag default heating temperature is 45℃, when the heating target temperature is lower than 40℃, the bag automatically heat to 45℃.  (2) The heating bag will start heating to the user’s set temperature automatically when it is 5℃ below the customer’s set temperature.  (3) When the heating bag is powered, beacause of the excess heat, the temperature will be higher than the set temperature within 5℃.-  SAFTY & FAST PTC HEATING TECHNOLOGY Using PTC original constant temperature heating, low-consumption heat cycle to keep food at a suitable temperature and keep the moisture of the food. It normally takes 15-20 minutes to warm the food, super efficient and energy-saving. (If the food was taken out of the fridge or where the ambient temperature is low, the heating time should be extended appropriately). - PACKAGE LIST Electric lunch box warmer includes: 1x electric lunch box ( 36*18*7cm ), 1x 12V power cord for cars/trucks, 1x 110V for home/office use, 1x 300D waterproof handbag, 1x product manual, 1x shoulder strap. Capacity 3.8L. - HOT FOOD WITHIN ARM’S REACH: Ideal for cooking healthy dishes, heating frozen boxed meals and warming comfort food at home, in the office, or at parties, potlucks, or gatherings.-  Warnings To avoid the danger of suffocation, keep this bag away from babies and children. Do not use in cribes, cots, beds, carriag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-H8GJFZNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUEBEL","source_asin":"B09BVQCLM9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BVQCLM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BVQCLM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
