window.products.push({"id":719594,"name":"Orelex Ice Cube Tray for Freezer, 2Packs Ice Trays with Bin and Lid for 110 Ice Cubes, Space Saving Ice Cube Molds Perfect for Cocktails, Waterbottles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nYE41-5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy To Release】- The pink ice tray is made of highly-elastic food-grade material. Flexible and Durable. Ice cubes release easily with just a twist. No need to wait for the ice cubes to melt a bit. You can empty the ice tray immediately after taking it out of the freezer. The ice cube mold & trays can not pour all cubes at a time. 【Ice Cube Tray with Lid】- The lid and the edge of the ice cube tray are designed higher for easy filling and easy transporting, which is not easy to spill. Don’t fill above the max fill line to keep ice cubes in the perfect nugget shape instead of sticking together. 【110 Ice Cubes】- The 2 packs of ice cube trays with lid and bin can make 110 mini nugget ice cubes each time. So you can enjoy iced coffee or cocktails at any time. Great for RV, home use, and parties. The pink ice cube tray with lid can also be used in making Miniature desserts, such as Jelly, chocolate, baby food, and frozen yogurt. Perfect size for ice chewer. 【Food-Grade Material & Spill-Resistant】- The pink ice trays for freezer are made of food-grade safety material, BPA free, odor free. Very suitable for non-private rooms such as office and student apartments. 【Stackable & Space Saving】- Stackable Ice Tray with lids keep ice fresh and sanitary by preventing ice from absorbing freezer odors. Also allows for stacking multiple trays. This 3 in 1 ice cube tray and bin combo includes: 2× pink ice cube trays with lids, 1× storage container, and 1× ice scooper. A must-have accessory for a mini fridge. 【Durable Ice Cube Tray with Lids】- The 55 mini ice cube trays use better materials and designs to make them more durable. No longer worry about breaking easily. Start to use them to enjoy iced drinks time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nYE41-5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orelex","source_asin":"B0B6G7DJF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6G7DJF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6G7DJF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
