window.products.push({"id":719696,"name":"Iittala Birds of Toikka Mouthblown Glass Bird, Red Cardinal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319K88Q5HSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Small miracles. That is the only way to describe the glass bird collection from iittala, including the Red Cardinal. Each of these beautiful birds is mouth blown and bright in coloration. The body and head are red with dark red wings and head. Resting at 5-1/4-inches by 8-inches, this bird is the perfect gift for any bird or iittala collector! The Red Cardinal is also perfect additional to your home or office, especially if there is sunlight! Designed by Ovia Toikka, collected by bird, glass and art lovers around the world, this Red Cardinal is unique and wonderful. Bring a piece of nature inside. Truly a small miracle! Created in Finland.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319K88Q5HSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iittala","source_asin":"B0001M138U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001M138U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001M138U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
