window.products.push({"id":719752,"name":"Dkocva SIXNEA Vinyl Record Clock - soda/pop Inspired","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Qnk7BqzoL._AC_SL1212_.jpg","description":"Wait until you see one actually hanging on a wall, unbelievably gorgeous! We have over 200 designs, so if you don't see what you like, just ask! And if we don't have it, talk to us about custom ordering something for a very fair price. An *American* made and cut vinyl album clock cut with precision to make the most unique gift or decoration imaginable. These are made with authentic 12 inch vinyl LP's(albums) with a new decorative label applied in the center and a clock that is completely silent (no tic toc here)! It is battery operated and takes only one AA battery. A built in hangar on the back of the clock mechanism makes it as simple as possible to hang. We have many designs so if you don't see something you are looking for, just ask! We will custom make designs too so don't be afraid to ask for anything, whether it be for your business, wedding, hobby or simply adding a name, etc. extremely unique and personal! The style/shape of the clock hands may vary from the picture, but the color will remain the same. ***Please keep in mind these are made from used, authentic 12 inch vinyl albums, and although we seriously try to use ones that are as new looking as possible, there can be blemishes or small scratches etc. Don't let this scare you, our final product quality is top notch! **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Qnk7BqzoL._AC_SL1212_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dkocva","source_asin":"B079HFM8V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079HFM8V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079HFM8V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":719753,"name":"Universal Window Seal for Portable Air Conditioner and Tumble Dryer, Casement Window Air Conditioner Seal, Crank Out Window Vent Kit for All Mobile Ai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712LAYL5+6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝙒𝙞𝙩𝙝 𝟯𝟬𝟬𝘾𝙈 (𝟭𝟭𝟴\") 𝙒𝙞𝙣𝙙𝙤𝙬 𝙎𝙚𝙖𝙡,𝙆𝙚𝙚𝙥 𝙃𝙤𝙩 𝘼𝙞𝙧 𝙊𝙪𝙩: When you use this portable ac window kit, you can easily put the portable AC tube out of the window. This neither blocks the light coming from the window nor does it require any disruption of construction to the window. Easily helps maintain the temperature of your choice, no matter how hot it is outside! Keeps you cool all summer long! 𝙀𝙣𝙚𝙧𝙜𝙮 & 𝘾𝙤𝙨𝙩 𝙎𝙖𝙫𝙞𝙣𝙜: Portable window air conditioner seal kit prevents warm air from entering your room, by creating a “closed environment” which keeps your room cool longer and significantly reduces the energy consumption of your air conditioner, saving you money on electricity and solving the worries caused by central air conditioning. In addition, this unit can be washed up to put in storage and use again next year! 𝙃𝙞𝙜𝙝-𝙌𝙪𝙖𝙡𝙞𝙩𝙮 𝙈𝙖𝙩𝙚𝙧𝙞𝙖𝙡 & 𝙍𝙚𝙪𝙨𝙖𝙗𝙡𝙚: The crank window ac kit is made of the latest thickened air conditioning material, with 4 zipper settings, can be very firmly fixed exhaust port, and sealed windows, to prevent pesky outdoor irritants and rainwater entry. The design of the Velcro makes it easy to disassemble, even if dirty. A gentle pull can be removed for washing/machine washing. 𝙀𝙖𝙨𝙮 𝙩𝙤 𝙄𝙣𝙨𝙩𝙖𝙡𝙡- 𝙉𝙤 𝙉𝙚𝙚𝙙 𝙩𝙤 𝘿𝙧𝙞𝙡𝙡 𝙃𝙤𝙡𝙚𝙨: This portable ac casement window seal does not need any window kits, adapters for your hose, or additional tools to install, because it does not need to drill holes in the window, just stick the Velcro, then stick the product, tie it with a fixed tie and you will never worry about falling off the exhaust pipe. It is compatible with most window types and portable air conditioners, removable & reusable, waterproof & rainproof 𝙁𝙞𝙩𝙨 𝙬𝙞𝙩𝙝 𝙈𝙤𝙨𝙩 𝙒𝙞𝙣𝙙𝙤𝙬𝙨: Suitable for bottom-hung windows, or skylights, it fits with most windows without any issues. Not Suitable for Sliding Windows, Vertical Push-pull Window, Stereo Revolving Windows. Pay attention： Any window with the largest side greater than 400cm is not suitable. PLEASE MEASURE the LENGTH of the Window BEFORE PURCHASING.suitable for dolonghi, lg, midea, shinco, ac window seal double hose universal ac window kit toshiba mobile air conditioner window kit portable ac window seal dual hose","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712LAYL5+6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKSTAR","source_asin":"B0B2VW5FPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2VW5FPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2VW5FPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
