window.products.push({"id":719876,"name":"Buganda Non-Slip 2 Pieces Bathroom Rugs Set Water Absorbent Soft Microfiber Shaggy Bath Mat Machine Washable Bath Rugs for Bathroom (17”x 24” + 17”x 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713juDnOCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber ❤ ULTRA PLUSH BATH RUGS SET: Buganda bathroom rugs set features a luxurious, fluffy and soft pile that soothes tired feet and shields toes from the cold floor. Our bath mats with unique fiber-locking technique prevent horrible fiber-dropping. The microfibers are very dense and not easily turn deflated after use, so it can maintain a new look. ❤ EXTRA ABSORBENT BATH MAT: The microfiber shaggy bath mats are much more absorbent than other materials bath rugs. High-pile microfiber helps save your floors from dripping water while you’re stepping out of the bath. ❤ NON-SLIP RUBBER BACKING: Buganda bathroom mat rug use TPR rubber backing which is much stronger and durable for long lasting use. The anti-skid backing prevent shifting and stays in place, providing protection for your family whenever it is used. ❤ MACHINE WASHABLE: Buganda bath rugs set are easy to clean, hand washed or fully machine washed is fine. The bath rugs have been tested and can be machine washed time and time again no worry that it could get fibers come away. Machine wash in cold water with mild detergent. Do not use chlorine or bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay to air dry. ❤ PERFECT SIZE & WIDE USE: This bathroom rug available in 3 sizes 17”x24” (40x60cm), 20”x32” (50x80cm), 17”x47” (40x120cm), and we also have 2 combination sizes 17”x24”+20”x32” and 17”x24”+17”x47”. Classic striped design makes it easy to go with any home decor, and can be applied in bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room, door entrances, pet rug and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713juDnOCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buganda","source_asin":"B085T5H4JP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085T5H4JP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085T5H4JP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
