window.products.push({"id":719910,"name":"Kitcoff Manual Coffee Grinder - Hand Beans Mill with 18-Click Settings, Stainless Steel Body with Ceramic Burr & Ergonomic Grip, Removable Hand Crank ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XCLKeLtWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need help making freshly-ground coffee at home? Aficionados agree that coffee made from scratch has fuller flavors and body. Bean quality aside, grinding lets the beans retain their essential oils, resulting in cups with richer taste and aroma. This is why coffee grinders are essential kitchen appliances for serious java enthusiasts. The thing is that not all of them are created equal. Poor quality mills simply chop your beans instead of grinding them, while others are way too expensive for most households. This leaves you wondering, is there a way for you to enjoy great coffee without breaking your bank account? This Manual Coffee Grinder from Kitcoff offers a perfect blend between quality and price! An inconsistent grind will negatively impact the taste of your brewed concoction. When coffee grounds aren't the same size, some will dissolve faster than others. Our coffee grinder with its ceramic burr breaks every bean into consistently-sized particles for even dissolution. Enjoy grounds that are just perfectly made for your French press, drip cones, and coffee makers! Our manual grinder gives you the same result as their electric counterparts but at the fraction of the price. It produces uniform granules to prevent under or over-extraction, which leaves a sour and overly bitter taste to your coffee. Plus, it helps you save on electricity, too! Our handheld tool is designed to be portable so you can make fresh coffee anytime, anywhere. Always enjoy a great cup of joe to jumpstart your day, whether you're camping or on a business trip. Here are more details about our manual coffee grinder: ☕ Equipped with handle holder ☕ Ergonomic non-slip grip ☕ Beautiful stainless steel body ☕ Perfect gift for coffee lovers Don't let your premium coffee beans go to waste. Add the Kitcoff Manual Coffee Grinder to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XCLKeLtWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitcoff","source_asin":"B09W63SN6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-719910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W63SN6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W63SN6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
